{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生の稲熊ひな（いなぐまひな）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日2度目ましてのブログです💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobLKuIp9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single  BACKS曲   ｢コインランドリー｣のMUSIC VIDEOが公開されました🔆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ?si=FI4n1I95l_AEHI-9"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう見てくださいましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの笑顔が大好き過ぎて、\n視聴回数、誰にも負けないくらい見てます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobtrxmR7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りこさんが撮ってくれました〜\nうれしいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私もりこさんのことたくさんカメラに収めたのに、デジカメからの写真の移行が難しくて、独り占め状態です。\nもう少し待っていてください…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobo2IcrV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob6FPvNl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くまさんを見つけてはしゃいでるところです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "家の、生まれた時からずっと一緒にいるくまのぬいぐるみと同じくらい年季入ってる\n癒されました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごく素敵なセットの中撮影していただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "世界観も衣装も曲調も全て好きなのですが、\n何より、笑顔のメンバーと顔を合わせながら踊れたのがすごく嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの振り付けもあって、\n早くBuddiesの皆さんの前で披露したい、大切な曲です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15枚目シングルも、よろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXnJ4UP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "控室にて、正座で磯部もちを食べてるにこにこももみがかわいかったー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｡.ꕤ………………………"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ライブまであと5日になりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生9人でステージに立たせていただけるこの機会は、当たり前じゃありません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ、来てくれた方に、もっと四期生を見ていたいと思っていただきたい。\n絶対、後悔させたくない。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その気持ちでリハーサルに臨んでいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "想いを届けられるよう全力で頑張ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【日程】\n2026年6月2日(火)　開場17:30/開演19:00\n2026年6月3日(水)　開場17:30/開演19:00"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "【会場】\nLaLa arena TOKYO-BAY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/page/4th_generation_live"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非お越しください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなでした〜"}], "source": "official"}